                    438.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Office of the President will review such new contracts valued at over $100,000 per year, using the Office of the President's contracting guidelines. Campuses shall review such contracts valued at $100,000 per year or less, using the UCOP contracting guidelines.",
